  "notes": {
    "s-a": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "A \u2014 stay in Ink, add structure.\n\nWhite dialog on a scrim, so fields finally have an edge. Each question becomes a section with its own label column, the way a settings page reads. Labels move from 10 px to 13 px. People carry a tinted avatar. Footer is pinned with the save shortcut on the left.\n\nStill flat: one popover shadow, no elevation system. Phone: a bottom sheet with a grabber.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": -620,
      "y": 1660
    },
    "s-b": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "B \u2014 Ink's colours, Material's bones.\n\nThe dialog is a grey tray, and each section is a white card on it (tonal layering). Fields are outlined with floating labels and leading icons. People are input chips. Either/or choices are segmented buttons. Actions are right-aligned the Material way.\n\nNo hue is added. Phone: a full-screen dialog with Save in the top bar.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": -620,
      "y": 3320
    },
    "s-c": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "C \u2014 Material 3, as Google draws it.\n\nA slate-blue seed generates the tonal palette: filled text fields, tonal and filled buttons, switches, a 28 px dialog with level-3 elevation, primary-coloured icons.\n\nIt is the most 'material' of the three, and the furthest from the rest of the app: these popups would be the only coloured, shadowed surfaces in an otherwise black-and-white Ink app. Type stays Lexend / Plus Jakarta rather than Roboto.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": -620,
      "y": 4980
    },
    "s-today": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "What ships now, drawn from the source.\n\nWhy it reads plain: a #EAEAEC dialog holding #F4F4F5 fields with a #F0F0F2 border \u2014 grey on grey on grey, so nothing has an edge. Every label is 10 px. Sections are just vertical gaps, so a nine-question form reads as one long column. The icon tile is the only shape on the page.\n\nThe four popups also disagree with each other: Log interaction uses a sans title, Title Case and a different footer.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0
    },
    "t-a": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 8000,
      "text": "A \u00b7 Ink, structured \u2014 picked",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1360
    },
    "t-b": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 8000,
      "text": "B \u00b7 Ink colours, Material anatomy",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3020
    },
    "t-c": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 8000,
      "text": "C \u00b7 Material 3",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4680
    },
    "t-today": {
